tests/ui/lexer/err_nfkc_long_identifier.sky:1:1: error: identifier is not in Unicode NFKC form
  |
1 | ﬁaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa = 1
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ not in NFKC form
  = note: `\u{FB01}aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa…` (67 bytes) is not in NFKC (Unicode Normalization Form KC), and Sky never normalizes identifiers
